feat: leader member detail page (portfolio reuse + promises/trend/actions)

New /leader/member/:memberId page reuses the member career portfolio
(useCareerDashboard + CareerProfileCard/Showcase/Timeline, already
leader-accessible) and adds three leader-only sections from
GET /members/{memberId}/insight: status trend (jargon-free level labels),
promises by date with status, and accumulated action plans by date.

Entry points:
- 1on1 members list now sourced from the team-members API (id+name) and
  each member navigates to the detail page.
- Dashboard 미이행 약속 card gets a per-member "자세히 보기" link.
